OL,3,AFlights at major US airports delayed
OL,4,Aafter cable cut by construction workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of flights have been delayed
OL,7,Fat major airports in the US after
OL,8,Fconstruction workers accidentally cut a
OL,9,Fcable needed for air traffic control.
OL,11,FGround stops and delays were issued on
OL,12,FMonday afternoon for airports in New
OL,13,FYork, Pennsylvania, New Jersey and
OL,14,FMassachusetts.
OL,16,FHours later, US Transportation
OL,17,FSecretary Sean Duffy said the cable had
OL,18,Fbeen repaired and airports would resume
OL,19,Fnormal operations, though delays were
OL,20,Fstill expected.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
