OL,3,AFlights at major US airports delayed
OL,4,Aafter cable cut by construction workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe major east coast disruption came
OL,7,Fahead of the UN General Assembly (UNGA)
OL,8,Fin New York City on Tuesday, which is
OL,9,Fexpected to be attended by scores of
OL,10,Fworld leaders arriving into New
OL,11,FYork-area airports.
